The following enhancement provides support for Curses(3)-style cursor
key input for movement of your spider!  I find this much easier that h-j-k-l.
After all, that's what cursor keys are for.  Apply these patches using Larry
Wall's patch program.  Note that you should have applied my 'movement
counter' patches already, or you will have to do some hand-editing.

